00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:55.700
Fact number one: The two people who played
Ferris Bueller's parents in Ferris Bueller's

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:59.850
Day Off met on set - and then got married!
Also they had kids and they didn't name any

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:02.050
