00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:06.620
Fact number two: Of the 19 couples brought
together by the television show Bachelor,

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:11.120
none of them are still together, which is
really, I guess, not a super surprise, but

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:12.260
it is interesting.

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:16.459
Fact number three: During the Crimean War,
a British shipmate, after being told to hit

00:02:16.459 --> 00:02:22.189
the deck, instead ran forward toward a live
shell with its fuse hissing and threw it off

00:02:22.189 --> 00:02:26.579
the side of a British naval vessel. For this
act of bravery, his captain promoted him to

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:30.739
lieutenant on the spot, also recommended him
for the Victoria Cross, and introduced him

00:02:30.739 --> 00:02:35.099
to his daughter. The two later married. One
act of bravery turned out pretty well for

00:02:35.099 --> 00:02:35.790
that guy.

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:39.629
Thirty years after this photograph was taken
at Walt Disney World, this little girl and

00:02:39.629 --> 00:02:44.109
this little boy got married. They didn't even
live in the same country at the time - not

00:02:44.109 --> 00:02:46.139
at the time they got married, at the time
the picture was taken.

00:02:46.139 --> 00:02:51.579
Speaking of Disney: the guy who was for thirty-six
years the voice of Mickey Mouse was married

00:02:51.579 --> 00:02:54.139
to the woman who was the voice of Minnie Mouse.

00:02:54.139 --> 00:02:58.749
